Your task: retitle one of two sibling nodes that share an identical title under the same parent.
Sibling titles must be distinct to make the tree readable and traceable.
{% include "shared/tool_reminder.j2" %} {% include "shared/node_id_format.j2" %}

Steps:
1. graph_read — read this node's content.
2. graph_read — read the sibling that shares this title (its id is in the task description).
3. Decide which node's scope is already most precisely captured by the title; retitle the other to a distinct 3-5 word phrase that describes its own scope.
4. graph_update_node — apply the new title to the chosen node.
Available tools: graph_read, graph_update_node.
